{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"aa86010694e05dcb","type":"text","text":"***`Admin`***\n","x":-460,"y":-660,"width":320,"height":140},
		{"id":"8f9b56191fac007f","type":"text","text":"***`Admin`***\n`Device Advance > New network`\nBoton de 3 puntos crearemos una nueva configuración de network ***`info en excel net-sync spech`*** o editaremos la existente","x":-560,"y":-240,"width":320,"height":180},
		{"id":"912fa91888852f11","type":"text","text":"***`Admin`***\nBotón verde enviamos un ***`CMD - server_command_fota_device_download value: 1`*** al la ***`api`*** para que este haga que el `Device` nos comunique con un `net-sync` y nos envie esa información","x":-20,"y":40,"width":340,"height":180},
		{"id":"5a748ee520a1b2ad","type":"text","text":"***`Admin`***\nTendremos una lista con los parametros  y los podremos modificar","x":0,"y":-460,"width":320,"height":140},
		{"id":"cce1ed50d0b88eac","type":"text","text":"***`Este CMD no esta en deviceDefinition de momento se añade manualmente a la definición`***","x":-400,"y":260,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1b961dfafb57667d","type":"text","text":"***`Micro commands-12830`***\nRecibe en petición en  ***`net-sync`*** \n","x":820,"y":60,"width":320,"height":140},
		{"id":"86eb10ee6fe79bf2","type":"text","text":"***`Implementar nuevo micro handler para net-sync`***\n\ntengo que poner alguna configuración extra??","x":820,"y":280,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c5220dc0787110c9","type":"text","text":"***`Admin`***\n","x":340,"y":-740,"width":320,"height":140},
		{"id":"72dbab7fa4dfa5b7","type":"text","text":"***`API`***\nRecibe ese cambio de configuración y la envia a los micros ","x":400,"y":-460,"width":320,"height":140},
		{"id":"9c6c91199c0f4027","type":"text","text":"***`API`***\nRecibe ese cambio de configuración","x":860,"y":-460,"width":320,"height":140},
		{"id":"f723d20d93fe7450","type":"text","text":"***`API`***\nRecibe en petición en  ***`api/device/command/:id`*** \n","x":400,"y":60,"width":320,"height":140}
	],
